":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"朱百年傳首祖愷之。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[{"id":"pa-nanshi024-wangsu-z","person_id":"em3_mum_s8d_AA","relation":"biographical_origin","place":{"source_name":"會稽山陰","place_id":null,"modern_identification":null},"source_term":"會稽山陰人也","date_expression":null,"status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-093","source_id":"s-songshu-093-zhubainian-ancestry-ws1962755","chapter_id":"c-songshu-093-zhubainian-ancestry","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-093-zhubainian-ancestry:p001","quote":"朱百年，會稽山陰人也。祖愷之，晉右衞將軍。父濤，揚州主簿。","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-093-zhubainian-ancestry:p001:m0000"}],"interpretation_note":"傳首籍貫。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-songshu-093-wangsu:p002","text":"素少有志行，家貧母老。初爲廬陵國侍郎，母憂去職。服闋，廬陵王紹爲江州，親舊勸素修完舊居，素不答，乃輕身往東陽，隱居不仕，頗營田園之資，得以自立。愛好文義，不以人俗累懷。世祖即位，欲搜揚隱退，下詔曰：「濟世成務，咸達隱微，軌俗興讓，必表淸節。朕昧旦求善，思惇薄風，琅邪王素、會稽朱百年，並廉約貞遠，與物無競，自足臯畝，志在不移。宜加褒引，以光難進。並可太子舍人。」大明中，太宰江夏王義恭開府辟召，辟素爲倉曹屬，太宗泰始六年，又召爲太子中舍人，並不就。素既屢被徴辟，聲譽甚髙。山中有蚿蟲，聲淸長，聽之使人不厭，而其形甚醜，素乃爲蚿賦以自況。七年，卒，時年五十四。","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-093-wangsu:p002:m0000","surface":"素","start":0,"end":1,"person_id":"x90_vgz_2uf_AAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-093-wangsu:p002:m0008","surface":"母","start":8,"end":9,"person_id":"916_z0f_u2a","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-093-wangsu:p002:m0019","surface":"母","start":19,"end":20,"person_id":"916_z0f_u2a","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-093-wangsu:p002:m0030","surface":"紹","start":30,"end":31,"person_id":"3uc_2s9_8oj","k